# Code Integrity & Design Rules

## Code Integrity & Import Hygiene
- Never finish a task without checking for syntax and import errors.
- Run `python -m py_compile <file>` and run tests via `pytest`.
- Avoid unused imports, circular imports, or unhandled exceptions.

## UI Design & Anti-AI-Slop Standards
- Strictly forbid using raw Unicode emojis (🔥, 🚀, 💰, etc.) as substitute icons.
- Always use vector icons (Lucide, SVG, Phosphor).
- Provide smooth micro-animations, tactile button depression, and Figma-grade visual hierarchy.

## Roblox UI Standards
- Follow `.agents/skills/roblox-elite-ui/SKILL.md`: 3D tactile buttons, tiled stud backgrounds, SoundService audio feedback, and Lucide vector icons.

## Computer Use Standards
- Follow `.agents/skills/advanced-computer-use/SKILL.md`: DPI awareness, interactive desktop attachment, and PAV (Perception-Action-Verification) loop.
